# Undercity Eliminator: "When this creature enters, you may sacrifice an artifact or creature. When you do, exile target creature an opponent controls." Bot1 (five free Moxen, a Memnite and an Island) casts it on turn 3 against Bot2's Mox Sapphire, Ornithopter and Phyrexian Walker. The sacrifice is up to one permanent of Bot1's (two are refused, so is a land, so is Bot2's Ornithopter); Bot1 sacrifices the Memnite. The exile then targets a creature an opponent controls: Bot1's own Undercity Eliminator and Bot2's Mox Sapphire (an artifact, not a creature) are refused, and the Ornithopter is exiled.

